                                "sense_id": "8a98a158-b56a-3154-ac47-da2f0fb8a6d2",
                                "text": "Hmmmm...I don't know about the combo...I've never tried that...but I love Xans and Valiums...well until I OD'd on Valiums and almost died...now I'm afraid of all pills..."
                            },
                            {
