                                "sense_id": "8a98a158-b56a-3154-ac47-da2f0fb8a6d2",
                                "text": "Upstairs I got Xans in an Advil bottle, I don't take them shits"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fa0a4c5d-cb56-4ad3-b0b3-b3e70edb4fd4",
                                "sense_id": "8a98a158-b56a-3154-ac47-da2f0fb8a6d2",
                                "text": "Georgia State senior, Damian Phillips thinks \"I've been prescribed Xans because I actually need them for stress and anxiety. Recreational use is all hype and something that people are doing to seem cool.\""
                            }
                        ]
